Songs on the Selfie Sing playlist include "Respect" by Aretha Franklin, "Girls Just Wanna Have Fun" by Cyndi Lauper, "Like a Virgin" by Madonna, "Wonderwall" by Oasis, "Hungry Like the Wolf" by Duran Duran, and "Baby One More Time" by Britney Spears.<br/>
<br/>
There isn't an option to take a Selfie Sing recording on every &zwnj;Apple Music&zwnj; song, but that could be something coming in the future. Selfie Sing appears to be an extension of the &zwnj;Apple Music&zwnj; Sing karaoke feature that came out in iOS 16.2.<br/>
<br/>
